  "description": "Current turn-around for a frameset is 8-10 weeks until shipment. This could be extended depending on options chosen. Please ask.\n\n***No complete builds available. Framesets only.***\n\nFEATURES AND INFORMATION\nDesigned And Developed By Milwaukee Bicycle Co. - Handmade By the old Waterford Precision Cycles*\n\nTUBING\nModern high-quality steel gives you a soulful connection between you, the bike, and the open road. Yet the lightweight True Temper Verus tubing and city sport geometry makes the frame stiff enough to stomp up steep hills, yet comfortable to spend the day riding.\n\nTIRE CLEARANCE\nClearance for 32c Tires.\n\nBRAKE CABLE ROUTING\nTop Tube Underside Brake Cable Routing.\n\nSTOCK DERAILLEUR ROUTING\nN/A\n\nBRAZE-ONS\nDown Tube Mounted Water Bottle Bosses\nTop Tube Brake Cable Guides\nStainless Steel Milwaukee Headbadge, Milwaukee Script And WI State Badges",
